# Try the system through the gateway (works in VS / VS Code REST Client / Rider).
@gateway = http://localhost:5000

### List products (Gateway -> ProductService)
GET {{gateway}}/products

### Place an order (Gateway -> OrderService -> ProductService, then event -> NotificationService)
POST {{gateway}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }

### Unknown product -> 400
POST {{gateway}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 99, "quantity": 1 }

### List orders
GET {{gateway}}/orders
